stateDiagram-v2
  requested --> draining
  draining --> reconciling
  reconciling --> isolated: old writer stopped or contained
  isolated --> bundle_ready: durable records plus pending responsibilities
  bundle_ready --> qualifying: profile policy budget and context checks
  qualifying --> restoring
  restoring --> validating: replay event delta without side effects
  validating --> activation_pending_environment: commit new epoch decision
  activation_pending_environment --> active: supervisor capability receipt verified
  activation_pending_environment --> paused_recovery: capability failure or unknown receipt
  reconciling --> paused_recovery: unknown uncontained writer
  qualifying --> paused_recovery: incompatible profile
